{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D pixel-based turn-based RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's setting is a small, floating landmass called an Ark, believed to be a massive aerial ecosystem constructed by ancient civilizations using magical technology. However, most of these Arks are now beyond human control, having become transformed nests for alien creatures. The heroine is aboard an adventure ship, gathering a group of adventurers from around the world. They earn rewards through exploration, treasure hunting, accepting bounties, and smuggling goods. As they drift above the sea of \u200b\u200bclouds, they search for their own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 different monsters, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 different pieces of equipment and costumes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over five chapters of story content, a vast map, rich side quests More exciting illustrations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056620?t=1759321597","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056620?t=1759321597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056620/9c2fcb6118a58b589b8d4a93dbb51a460bfb24e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759321597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056620/9c2fcb6118a58b589b8d4a93dbb51a460bfb24e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759321597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D pixel-based turn-based RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's setting is a small, floating landmass called an Ark, believed to be a massive aerial ecosystem constructed by ancient civilizations using magical technology. However, most o